  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You attempt to divine the future by employing some other divining tool. You receive an omen about the results of a specific course of action that you plan to take within the next 30 minutes. The GM chooses from the following possible omens:\n<em> Weal, for good results\n</em> Woe, for bad results\n<em> Weal and woe, for both good and bad results\n</em> Nothing, for results that aren’t especially good or bad\nThe creation doesn’t take into account any possible circumstances that might change the outcome, such as the loss or gain of a companion.</p>",
